    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classEvent" kindref="compound">Event</ref> representing a keyboard key press/release. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contains information about which key was pressed, the action type, and the state of modifier keys (Ctrl, Shift, Alt).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This event is dispatched by <ref refid="classSDLEventTranslator" kindref="compound">SDLEventTranslator</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classSDLEventTranslator" kindref="compound">SDLEventTranslator</ref>, <ref refid="classEventBus" kindref="compound">EventBus</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
